1
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,240
Hi! You must be Liam. Nice to meet you.

2
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:03,660
And you're Maya? Great to finally meet.

3
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:06,820
So, what are you drinking tonight?

4
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:10,500
I'll get a glass of sparkling water, please.

5
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:14,180
Good choice. I think I'll have a beer.

6
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:17,600
This place is really cozy, isn't it?

7
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,980
So, what do you usually do for fun?

8
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:36,400
I love hiking and trying new recipes.

9
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:39,820
Oh, cool! I'm into hiking too, actually.

10
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:43,500
No way! What's your favorite trail around here?

11
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:47,440
I like the one up by the old lighthouse.

12
00:04:48,140 --> 00:04:50,860
Me too! This is quite a coincidence.

13
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,980
Guess what? My date last night was awesome!

14
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:22,140
No way! Tell me everything, sis!

15
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:25,560
He was so charming and genuinely interesting.

16
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:29,240
That's fantastic! What did you guys talk about?

17
00:08:29,940 --> 00:08:33,180
Hiking, cooking, travel... We had so much in common.

18
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:36,340
Aww, that's so sweet! Sounds promising.

19
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:36,980
He's really handsome too, which helps a lot.

20
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:40,400
Of course! So, when's the second date?

21
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,820
He already asked! We're going next Saturday.

22
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:47,240
Yay! I knew you'd hit it off.

23
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:50,660
I'm really excited. This could be something.

24
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:54,340
Keep me updated. Don't leave out any details!

